a-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasd3d7xm/"></a>9-tib &#171;Отчет о кожно-венерических заболеваниях&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="248" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr248"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfase8hvae/"></a>годовая</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr249/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="249" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr249"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas3n177e/"></a>Ведомственная отчетность Министерства здравоохранения</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr250/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="250" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr250"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasdnv2ep/"></a>50.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr251/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="251" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr251"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasfq8u5l/"></a>10-tib &#171;Отчет о заболеваниях психическими расстройствами и расстройствами поведения за 20__год (кроме заболеваний, связанных с употреблением психоактивных веществ)&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr252/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="252" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr252"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasdwzdls/"></a>годовая</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr253/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="253" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr253"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasd05cgg/"></a>Ведомственная отчетность Министерства здравоохранения</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr254/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="254" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr254"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfastbde1w/"></a>51.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr255/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="255" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr255"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasxmeeov/"></a>11-tib &#171;Отчет о заболеваниях наркологическими расстройствами&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr256/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="256" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr256"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasti4da6/"></a>годовая</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr257/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="257" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr257"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas1tlmq4/"></a>Ведомственная отчетность Министерства здравоохранения</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr258/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="258" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr258"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas6n6d1m/"></a>52.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr259/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="259" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr259"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasgasg4q/"></a>12-tib &#171;Отчет о числе заболеваний, зарегистрированных у больных, проживающих в районе обслуживания лечебного учреждения&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr260/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="260" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr260"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasmgd321/"></a>годовая</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr261/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="261" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr261"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas89rmvv/"></a>Ведомственная отчетность Министерства здравоохранения</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr262/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="262" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr262"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasx66w4q/"></a>53.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr263/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="263" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr263"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas4t6t3g/"></a>15-tib &#171;Отчет о медицинских кадрах по специальностям&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr264/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="264" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr264"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasavw99d/"></a>годовая</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr265/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="265" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr265"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfaseb0kpv/"></a>Форма статистической отчетности 1-tib (годовая)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr266/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="266" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr266"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasgvsmvc/"></a>54.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr267/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="267" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr267"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasr4kitw/"></a>16-tib &#171;Отчет о деятельности оздоровительных учреждений&#187;&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr268/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="268" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr268"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfash9ch0z/"></a>годовая</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr269/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="269" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr269"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas6usadp/"></a>Форма статистической отчетности 2-tur</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr270/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="270" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr270"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasfgctm0/"></a>55.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr271/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="271" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr271"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfaslrvig4/"></a>17-tib &#171;Отчет о результатах исследования крови на антитела к ВИЧ&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr272/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="272" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr272"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas4ug5i2/"></a>квартальная</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr273/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="273" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr273"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasu1988g/"></a>Форма статистической отчетности 18-tib (годовая)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr274/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="274" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr274"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas0sfz93/"></a>56.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr275/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="275" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr275"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas38i1v9/"></a>1-mehnat shakliga ilova (MTЕ) Сведения об обеспеченности и перспективной потребности предприятий в специалистах с высшим и средним специальным профессиональным образованием</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr276/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="276" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr276"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasywh6kv/"></a>единовременная</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr277/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="277" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr277"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasui7rrn/"></a>Ведомственная отчетность Министерства занятости и трудовых отношений</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr278/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="278" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr278"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasa4swhc/"></a>57.&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr279/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="279" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr279"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasimasvb/"></a>5-TB &#171;Отчет о счетах клиентов, не осуществляющих финансово-хозяйственную деятельность в течение установленных сроков&#187;&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr280/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="280" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr280"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasx08pfh/"></a>квартальная</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr281/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="281" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr281"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasf5b2l7/"></a>Ведомственная отчетность Центрального банка</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr282/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="282" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr282"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasncqwcb/"></a>58.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.12%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr283/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="283" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr283"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasf47m7g/"></a>1-registr &#171;Отчёт о бездействующих и не сформировавших в течение установленного законодательством срока уставные фонды предприятиях и предприятиях, находящихся в процессе добровольной ликвидации&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr284/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="284" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr284"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasvzp450/"></a>месячная&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr285/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="285" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr285"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasiy6u5t/"></a>Сведения регистрирующих органов посредством электронного обмена</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.71%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr286/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="286" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr286"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasziyagx/"></a>59.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 49.