anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr315/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="315" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr315"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas4sd4m0/"></a>Перечень<br>форм государственной статистической отчетности, по которым сокращается периодичность их представления</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 6.27%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr316/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="316" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr316"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasrc9g7g/"></a><strong>№&#8206;</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 76.38%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr317/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="317" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr317"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasi4qz7p/"></a><strong>Наименование форм статистической отчетности &#8206;</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr318/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="318" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr318"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas26zoeu/"></a><strong>Периодичность&#8206;</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr319/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="319" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr319"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasp2bkg8/"></a><strong>с июля 2012 года</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 6.27%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr320/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phra