le="text-align:left" h_size="" class="doc__untyped-name"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr391/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="391" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr391"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas154eu7/"></a>Перечень<br>форм налоговой отчетности, по которым с 1 января 2013 года сокращается периодичность их представления</span></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr392/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="392" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr392"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas4wq2p4/"></a><strong>№&#8206;</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr393/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="393" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr393"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas945t42/"></a><strong>Наименование форм налоговой отчетности&#8206;</strong></p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr394/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="394" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr394"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas43tp4r/"></a><strong>Периодичность</strong><br><strong><strong>&#8206; представления </strong><br><strong>&#8206;налоговой</strong><br><strong>&#8206; отчетности&#8206;</strong></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr395/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="395" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr395"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas4qlxsz/"></a>1.&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr396/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="396" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr396"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasli7g3v/"></a>Расчет единого налогового платежа&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr397/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="397" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr397"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasa7ovz8/"></a>ежеквартально &#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr398/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="398" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr398"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas8dabcb/"></a>2.&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr399/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="399" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr399"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfask0fgpy/"></a>Справка-расчет единого налогового платежа с<br>&#8206; учетом минимального размера ЕНП, прилагаемая к<br>&#8206;Расчету единого налогового платежа&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr400/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="400" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr400"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfashri9ub/"></a>ежеквартально&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr401/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="401" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr401"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfaso6srg1/"></a>3.&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr402/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="402" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr402"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasg6wkcu/"></a>Расшифровка начисленных доходов физическим лицам<br>&#8206;(приложение № 1 к Сведениям о суммах начисленных и<br>&#8206;фактически выплаченных доходов и суммах удержанного<br>&#8206; налога на доходы физических лиц)&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr403/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="403" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr403"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfashyg3nf/"></a>раз в год&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr404/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="404" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr404"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasm40n4u/"></a>4.&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr405/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="405" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr405"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasrpr12c/"></a>Расшифровка доходов физических лиц, освобожденных<br>&#8206;от налогообложения (приложение № 2 к Сведениям о<br>&#8206;суммах начисленных и фактически выплаченных доходов<br>&#8206;и суммах удержанного налога на доходы физических лиц)&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr406/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="406" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr406"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasgohxqq/"></a>раз в год&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas8uf2gl/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas21ugha/"></a>Расчет налога на добавленную стоимость&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfasms9v9p/"></a>ежеквартально&#8206;</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 4.89%;"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfaszg8gf0/"></a>6.&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 84.66%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr411"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfas4bb9pd/"></a>Расчет акцизного налога&#8206;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/bssPhr412/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="412" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr412"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/8919/dfaswpn